    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No One Sleeps Tonight </strong>is a game consisting of multiple midnight scenes. You will travel through several environments with unique gameplay and styles to experience different nighttime emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/00cace6128f213fe2dc8f04410ef728c.poster.avif?t=1750294287\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/00cace6128f213fe2dc8f04410ef728c.webm?t=1750294287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/00cace6128f213fe2dc8f04410ef728c.mp4?t=1750294287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game includes eight unique scenes, each representing a character's experience under the cover of night. You could be a sniper waiting for your target on the battlefield, a child sneaking out of the room at midnight, or a traveler waiting for a bus to come in the rain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/061b072f4097fa40814db05fe7aee306.poster.avif?t=1750294287\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/061b072f4097fa40814db05fe7aee306.webm?t=1750294287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/061b072f4097fa40814db05fe7aee306.mp4?t=1750294287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the differences between environments, each scene also has different gameplay and ending conditions. Will you drive a speeding car on a rainy mountain road, or walk quietly down a silent alley in search of your destination?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/5dcd8376c20f1718f91ea30642092ec0.poster.avif?t=1750294287\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/5dcd8376c20f1718f91ea30642092ec0.webm?t=1750294287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/5dcd8376c20f1718f91ea30642092ec0.mp4?t=1750294287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make during the night may unlock new items and lead you to the next moonlit space. We hope that each experience will remind you of your own nighttime emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/67ff5e3e67c16b1439440fb3fbdc06fb.poster.avif?t=1750294287\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/67ff5e3e67c16b1439440fb3fbdc06fb.webm?t=1750294287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/67ff5e3e67c16b1439440fb3fbdc06fb.mp4?t=1750294287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then, have a good <strong><i>NIGHT.</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No One Sleeps Tonight </strong>is a game consisting of multiple midnight scenes. You will travel through several environments with unique gameplay and styles to experience different nighttime emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/00cace6128f213fe2dc8f04410ef728c.poster.avif?t=1750294287\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/00cace6128f213fe2dc8f04410ef728c.webm?t=1750294287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/00cace6128f213fe2dc8f04410ef728c.mp4?t=1750294287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game includes eight unique scenes, each representing a character's experience under the cover of night. You could be a sniper waiting for your target on the battlefield, a child sneaking out of the room at midnight, or a traveler waiting for a bus to come in the rain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/061b072f4097fa40814db05fe7aee306.poster.avif?t=1750294287\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/061b072f4097fa40814db05fe7aee306.webm?t=1750294287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/061b072f4097fa40814db05fe7aee306.mp4?t=1750294287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the differences between environments, each scene also has different gameplay and ending conditions. Will you drive a speeding car on a rainy mountain road, or walk quietly down a silent alley in search of your destination?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/5dcd8376c20f1718f91ea30642092ec0.poster.avif?t=1750294287\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/5dcd8376c20f1718f91ea30642092ec0.webm?t=1750294287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/5dcd8376c20f1718f91ea30642092ec0.mp4?t=1750294287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make during the night may unlock new items and lead you to the next moonlit space. We hope that each experience will remind you of your own nighttime emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/67ff5e3e67c16b1439440fb3fbdc06fb.poster.avif?t=1750294287\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/67ff5e3e67c16b1439440fb3fbdc06fb.webm?t=1750294287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767360/extras/67ff5e3e67c16b1439440fb3fbdc06fb.mp4?t=1750294287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then, have a good <strong><i>NIGHT.</i></strong></p>",
